    "description": "A probabilistic geospatial framework for assessing telecommunications accessibility and resilience at Australian evacuation facilities. The software integrates evacuation facility locations, telecommunications infrastructure, bushfire and flood hazards, and administrative boundaries to evaluate coverage, infrastructure redundancy, and service continuity under different deployment scenarios and hazard conditions.",
